{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:38 2026-10-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:38 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:38 2026-10-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"巴士失控撞毀鐵欄。fb：是日快快-巴士即日相\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7f21db00756af944886622db3924a93/2026-10/8887.jpg\"/><p>今（18日）午2時49分，一輛龍運巴士駛至東涌航天城時，突失控狂飆，撞毀鐵欄停下，巴士車頭損毀，泵把甩脫，慶幸沒有人受傷，警方接報到場，初步相信車長踩錯油門肇事。</p><img alt=\"巴士失控撞毀鐵欄。fb：是日快快-巴士即日相\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41fbfc3f4f685831525bbe8a043446ee/2026-10/01_1_34.jpg\" title=\"巴士失控撞毀鐵欄。fb：是日快快-巴士即日相\"/><p>巴士失控撞毀鐵欄。fb：是日快快-巴士即日相</p><img alt=\"巴士失控撞毀鐵欄。fb：是日快快-巴士即日相\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6644fb286319be8d5c06c255e319ed6d/2026-10/02_37.jpg\" title=\"巴士失控撞毀鐵欄。fb：是日快快-巴士即日相\"/><img alt=\"巴士失控撞毀鐵欄。fb：是日快快-巴士即日相\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a234667393faff9c2f31a2e5a901fa0a/2026-10/03_1_23.jpg\" title=\"巴士失控撞毀鐵欄。fb：是日快快-巴士即日相\"/>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T09:19:31.519469+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":4,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T08:38:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T21:37:52.699839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T09:17:35.720183+00:00","content_hash":"2edee4cdc8ea33995a772cd5d40412c83eadb9a26411828ce34dabbdb6858d88","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}